    <http://example.org/node/chunk61> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's PM methodologies, past public sector references, consortium partners, available capacity, and governance practices, how can our company's coordinate the consortium to provide a coherent tender response that meets these requirements?" ;
