    <http://example.org/node/chunk62> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To coordinate the consortium and provide a coherent tender response, I will leverage our company's expertise in digital transformation, AI solutions, and public sector IT. our company's will utilize our company's project management methodologies, such as PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFe, to ensure a structured approach." ;
