    <http://example.org/node/chunk64> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To guarantee explainability of recommendations or proposals, our company's will ensure that our company's solution is designed with transparency and accountability in mind. our company's past experience in delivering complex IT projects to public sector clients, such as Comune di Torino and Métropole de Lyon, demonstrates our company's ability to comply with regulatory requirements." ;
