    <http://example.org/node/chunk68> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client demands high availability (99.9%), compatibility with municipal services needs, integration with existing systems of information (notably business softwares, civil status, town planning, electronic management of documents), and compliance with sovereignty constraints (data hosting in European Union, no transfer outside European Union)." ;
