    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requirements for high availability, compatibility with municipal services needs, integration with existing systems of information, and compliance with sovereignty constraints can be addressed as follows: 1. **High Availability (99.9%)**: FULLY COVERED. our performance benchmarks indicate that our have achieved 99.92% availability in past projects, which exceeds The client requirement. our propose using our cloud architecture expertise, specifically with OVHcloud and Scaleway, to ensure high availability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk71> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our can leverage our experience with containerization (Docker, Kubernetes) and monitoring tools (Prometheus, Grafana) to maintain and improve upon this level of availability. 2. **Compatibility with Municipal Services Needs**: PARTIALLY COVERED." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "While our have experience in integrating with various systems through API gateways (Kong, Apigee) and message brokers (Apache Kafka, RabbitMQ), specific compatibility with all municipal services might require additional customization or integration work. our proposed architecture includes working closely with the client to identify and integrate with the client existing systems, leveraging our expertise in API standards (REST, GraphQL) and ERP/CRM connectors (SAP, Salesforce, Oracle). 3. **Integration with Existing Systems of Information**: PARTIALLY COVERED. our have experience integrating with various document management systems (Alfresco, Maarch Courrier, OpenKM) and can adapt to other business software through our API integration capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, the extent of this coverage depends on the specific systems in use by the client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our proposed architecture involves a thorough assessment of the client's existing infrastructure to design tailored integrations that meet the client's needs, utilizing our expertise in identity providers (Active Directory/LDAP, Keycloak) for secure and seamless integration. 4. **Compliance with Sovereignty Constraints**: FULLY COVERED. our can ensure data hosting within European Union through our partnerships with cloud providers like OVHcloud and Scaleway, which offer hosting solutions that comply with European Union sovereignty requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk75> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our adhere to strict data protection policies, including encryption (AES-256 at rest, TLS 1.3 in transit) and compliance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), ensuring no unauthorized transfer of data outside European Union." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk76> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed architecture to meet these requirements includes: - Utilizing cloud services from providers that comply with European Union sovereignty constraints. - Designing a highly available architecture leveraging containerization and orchestration tools. - Implementing robust monitoring and logging systems to quickly identify and resolve any issues affecting availability or performance. - Conducting thorough assessments of the client's existing systems to plan tailored integrations. - Ensuring all data is encrypted both at rest and in transit, with strict access controls and compliance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

